cff-version: 1.2.0
title: The Civilian Geopolitical Reality Map
message: If you cite this work, please cite the version you consulted.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Sánchez Pineda
    given-names: Arturo
abstract: >-
  A civilian framework for reading state conduct through instruments,
  dependencies and costs, with a manual, five case studies and a claim and
  source ledger in which every factual claim is classified by evidence type and
  traced to a primary or authoritative source. Published in English and Spanish.
keywords:
  - international law
  - state accountability
  - evidence classification
  - Venezuela
  - open documentation
version: "0.3"
date-released: 2026-08-17
